WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.471 --> 00:00:03.054
(gentle music)

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.160
- [Voiceover] What if
you could speak your mind

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.170
without fear of judgment?

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:18.030
We brought together seven strangers,

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.500
protected their identities,

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.383
and created a space for them
to be completely honest.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:26.043
What will be revealed when
they take the mask off?

00:00:28.959 --> 00:00:30.000
(dramatic drum music)

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.241
- [Director] There is something
wrong with LGBT people.

00:00:34.241 --> 00:00:36.951
(timer beeping)

00:00:36.951 --> 00:00:39.960
(light bulbs chiming)

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.300
- [Kabal] I'm gonna say a strong no.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.260
Yes I believe that homosexuality is a sin,

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.283
but saying that like LGBTQ+ people,

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:54.720
there's something wrong
with them as people,

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:55.920
as human beings,

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.962
that's a harsh statement. (laughs)

00:00:58.962 --> 00:01:00.780
So it's a hard topic.

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.220
- [Dmitri] This is a
really sensitive topic

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:05.610
because I know that a lot of LGBTQ people

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:07.410
have been hurt by the church,

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.880
they've been hurt by Christians.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.180
I personally have family
members who identify as they

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:14.010
who are homosexual.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.130
While God hates sin, He loves the people,

00:01:17.130 --> 00:01:18.570
and He loves the homosexual,

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.020
and He loves the transgender
because He died for them.

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:26.880
But the problem that I
do see with LGBTQ people

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:29.070
is that the lifestyle,

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:30.960
it does take away a lot of things.

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.720
They're depressed, they're
lonely all the time

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.090
and that's not the life
that God called for you.

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:37.560
When you receive Christ,

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:41.280
the spirit of God can deliver
you from homosexuality

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.480
and I've seen it happen.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:45.990
The people who identify
as bisexual or homosexual

00:01:45.990 --> 00:01:47.400
and God delivers them

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.433
and they no longer choose
to identify that way.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:54.600
- [David] One thing, the Lord says that

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.790
if you have sinned against one law,

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:58.320
you have broken all the laws.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:02.580
And so every single human being is wrong.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.830
Like if you ask that question,
are homosexuals wrong?

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:05.663
Well sure.

00:02:05.663 --> 00:02:07.560
But are they a different type of wrong?

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.200
No, they're not a different type of wrong.

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.320
They are the same wrong as I am.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.260
- [Penny] I feel like we tend to magnify

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:17.970
the LGBTQ community.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:20.880
For example, I come from
a Hispanic household

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:24.180
and sexual abuse is brushed
under the rug so many times,

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:25.013
straight,

00:02:25.013 --> 00:02:28.860
but you choose to magnify,
let's say my gay cousin

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.199
over my molester uncle.

00:02:31.199 --> 00:02:32.667
You know what I mean?
- Facts, yup.

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:33.870
- There's something wrong with both

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:34.703
- [Calvin] And the question is then

00:02:34.703 --> 00:02:37.800
why do we magnify the
sin of homosexuality?

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.590
It's because no one goes around
saying murdering is okay,

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.110
that theft is okay,

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:44.400
but there are people going around saying,

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.460
well, love is love and
homosexuality is just love

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:49.050
and they're trying to justify it.

00:02:49.050 --> 00:02:53.460
And so the church has to
do some sort of defense

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:57.240
and that's why this sin gets
more attention than the others.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.160
And so they can escape their shame,

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.530
not by marching down a
street shouting pride,

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.990
embrace who you are, look within,

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:06.000
they can escape their shame
by casting it on Christ

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.339
and receiving His forgiveness.
- [Penny] Yes, amen.

00:03:08.339 --> 00:03:09.390
(dramatic drum music)

00:03:09.390 --> 00:03:12.800
- [Director] Women who get
abortions are murderers.

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.795
(timer beeping)

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:19.128
(light bulbs vibrating)

00:03:21.091 --> 00:03:23.400
- [Rillian] It is God who
gives and takes away life.

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:27.600
Man or woman has no place taking a life

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:31.170
