00:03:31.170 --> 00:03:36.060
There is no going around that
one I think for Christians.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:40.923
You kill a baby, that
makes you a murderer.

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:43.383
- [Kabal] This topic,

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:48.030
sorry, gets me emotional because (sighs)

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:51.713
I've seen people go through
that and (sighs) sorry.

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:58.440
And they feel it in their
soul and in their spirit

00:03:58.440 --> 00:03:59.553
that it was wrong.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:05.253
And they deal with that pain
and that shame and regret.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:09.690
My husband himself, him and his sisters

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:11.790
they are all a product of (beep)

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.460
And I mean, that's my husband. (chuckles)

00:04:14.460 --> 00:04:17.280
So to imagine that,
like, he wouldn't be here

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:20.823
if his mother didn't decide
to keep them and raise them.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:24.870
It's sad to think about.

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:27.570
- [Cashqu] Maybe it was
not in a good experience,

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:28.829
maybe you were (beep),

00:04:28.829 --> 00:04:30.240
maybe you were victim
to something abusive,

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.550
maybe it wasn't planned,

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:33.540
but let me tell you something.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.280
God, He's never early, never late.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:36.240
He's always on time.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.600
And the fact that you were
given this gift of life,

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:42.030
and if you can't handle it
or you can't take care of it,

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:43.890
there are options.

00:04:43.890 --> 00:04:44.880
- [Director] Well, I'm
just wondering then.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:46.320
What would you think of people

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.920
who, like, stand outside
of, like, abortion places

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:52.146
and try to stop people?

00:04:52.146 --> 00:04:52.979
(Kabal chuckling)

00:04:52.979 --> 00:04:54.840
- [Kabal] It makes me so upset,

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:56.610
