00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:34.650
and I can't imagine a more miserable place

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:38.763
than away from the perfect
creator of all things.

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.287
- [Calvin] In John 6, Jesus says that,

00:11:41.287 --> 00:11:43.290
"Of all those that the
Father has given me,

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:45.180
I will not lose one."

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.610
And so God is faithful and just

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:51.150
and I trust God that He
will save all of His people.

00:11:51.150 --> 00:11:54.180
I do pray for my loved
ones who are unbelievers.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:55.920
I share the gospel with them,

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:58.710
but ultimately I know
it doesn't depend on me.

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:00.360
Salvation is in His hands.

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:04.080
So it's not for me to fear or worry.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:06.450
- [Dmitri] In the Bible it says that

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.730
it's God's will for everyone to be saved,

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:11.100
but at the same time the truth is

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.360
is that not everyone will.

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:14.520
When I was a non-believer,
I would always wonder,

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:16.350
why are Christians always wanting

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:19.590
to shove their beliefs down my throat?

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.260
We know what the Bible says
that people will go to hell

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.420
and if we don't tell people about it,

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.640
that blood is almost on our hands.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:31.590
And I do fear that there will
be people that I know and love

00:12:31.590 --> 00:12:33.960
who won't ever come to God,

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:36.303
but I know that there
is still hope for them.

00:12:37.553 --> 00:12:39.710
- [Director] We'll have
you put your masks back on.

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:42.293
(gentle music)

